Great—let’s pick a default and start building.

Default project: AI-notes web app
- What it is: A simple web app to save notes and auto-generate short summaries with AI.
- Stack: Next.js (App Router, TypeScript) + Tailwind CSS + Prisma + SQLite + OpenAI.
- Why: Fast to scaffold, no external DB needed, easy to extend later.

Steps to build

1) Create app
- npx create-next-app@latest ai-notes --typescript --eslint --tailwind --app --src-dir
- cd ai-notes

2) Install deps
- npm i @prisma/client prisma openai
- npx prisma init

3) Prisma schema (prisma/schema.prisma)
- datasource db {
  provider = "sqlite"
  url      = "file:./dev.db"
}
- generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}
- model Note {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  title     String
  content   String
  summary   String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

